<p>文档地址：<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/aspnet/core/blazor/fundamentals/routing?view=aspnetcore-8.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/aspnet/core/blazor/fundamentals/routing?view=aspnetcore-8.0</a></p>
